        Notes:
        - Uid: 765511
          Name: Summary
          Text: 'This is an example general damage graph, you can use it for any
            where a direct damage needs to be applied.

            Feel free to
            modify it based on your game design.'
          Position: {x: -812, y: -1334.8572}
          Size: {x: 1159.4286, y: 450.2857}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 1
        - Uid: 3849275
          Name: When Dealer is null
          Text: Some times the dealer is some none-entity object like lava, for such
            case we will give up tag comparison.
          Position: {x: -1677.1428, y: -509.14285}
          Size: {x: 426.28564, y: 208}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 33890208
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedAtk\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the attack power value."
          Position: {x: -2882.8572, y: 71.42857}
          Size: {x: 381.14282, y: 171.42856}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 71650702
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedCrit\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the critcal chance value."
          Position: {x: -3501.7144, y: 784.5714}
          Size: {x: 373.14282, y: 172}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 246978
          Name: Damage formulas
          Text: 'We used basic damage formulas:

            Dmg = (100 * Atk)/(Def
            + 100) so attacks always do at least some damage.'
          Position: {x: -1457.7142, y: -206.28572}
          Size: {x: 534.8571, y: 198.28572}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 87016488
          Name: 
          Text: If the target is invincible, The damage will be 0.
          Position: {x: -2157.1428, y: 697.1429}
          Size: {x: 300, y: 100}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 59062753
          Name: 
          Text: Randomly instant kill target base on Dealer's 'death' rate.
          Position: {x: -1548, y: 222.85713}
          Size: {x: 344, y: 138.85715}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 13955411
          Name: 
          Text: Only apply damage when the final damage value is greater than 0
          Position: {x: -861.7143, y: 170.85713}
          Size: {x: 301.14288, y: 125.14285}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 24382353
          Name: 
          Text: If Dealer is not null and the Target has 'Reflect Damage' rate greater
            than 0, then reflect the final damage to the Dealer based on the 'Reflect
            Damage' rate.
          Position: {x: 1387.4286, y: -1100.5715}
          Size: {x: 542.8572, y: 185.14288}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 35373417
          Name: Reduce HP
          Text: Reduce the Target's HP based on the final damage value.
          Position: {x: 991.4286, y: 48.571426}
          Size: {x: 300.5714, y: 210.85715}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 85634938
          Name: 
          Text: 'If the target is blocking,

            Compare the angle between
            its forward direction and the vector between the Dealer and Target with
            the ''block'' attribute(Degrees).'
          Position: {x: -2155.4285, y: 1201.1428}
          Size: {x: 312.5713, y: 262.85718}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 159811
          Name: Final Damage
          Text: 
          Position: {x: -1184, y: 1248.5714}
          Size: {x: 281.7143, y: 100}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
