        Notes:
        - Uid: 765511
          Name: Summary
          Text: "This is an simple version example of <color=#FFEE22><b>General Damage
            Graph</b></color>, you can use it for any where a direct damage needs
            to be applied. \nFeel free to modify it based on your game design.\n\nDamage
            Formulas:\n<color=#FFCC22>Dmg = (100 * Atk)/(Def + 100)</color>\n\nSet
            '<color=#22EEFF>FixedAtk</color>' and '<color=#22EEFF>FixedCrit</color>'
            Dynamic Variable value if there is no entity as damage dealer.\nSet '<color=#22EEFF>TargetOTE</color>'
            as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for
            apply it to the Target upon hit.\nSet '<color=#22EEFF>DealerOTE</color>'
            as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for
            apply it to the damage Dealer upon hit.\nLeave <color=#FFCC22>-1</color>
            for both of them if you don't want to apply any effect upon hit.\n\nSet
            <color=#22EEFF>'dmgMulti'</color> as <color=#FFCC22>multiplier of the
            final damage</color>, you can bind this value with different skills,
            combo attacks, make them have their own damage multiplier value.\n\nOther
            calcultions included:<color=#FFCC22>\n- Critical Damage\n</color>"
          Position: {x: -818.2857, y: -1564}
          Size: {x: 1168.5714, y: 618.8571}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 1
        - Uid: 3849275
          Name: When Dealer is null
          Text: Some times the dealer is some none-entity object like lava, for such
            case we will give up tag comparison.
          Position: {x: -1361.7142, y: -636}
          Size: {x: 426.28564, y: 208}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 33890208
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedAtk\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the attack power value."
          Position: {x: -2882.8572, y: 71.42857}
          Size: {x: 381.14282, y: 171.42856}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 71650702
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedCrit\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the critical chance value."
          Position: {x: -3501.7144, y: 784.5714}
          Size: {x: 373.14282, y: 172}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 246978
          Name: Damage formulas
          Text: 'We used basic damage formulas:

            Dmg = (100 * Atk)/(Def
            + 100) so attacks always do at least some damage.'
          Position: {x: -1548.5714, y: -216}
          Size: {x: 645.7143, y: 156}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 13955411
          Name: 
          Text: Only apply damage when the final damage value is greater or equal
            than 0, to avoid unexpected bug.
          Position: {x: -861.1429, y: 169.14285}
          Size: {x: 297.7143, y: 193.71428}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 35373417
          Name: Reduce HP
          Text: Reduce the Target's HP based on the final damage value.
          Position: {x: 999.4286, y: -405.71426}
          Size: {x: 300.5714, y: 210.85713}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 159811
          Name: Final Damage
          Text: 
          Position: {x: -1186.8572, y: 530.2857}
          Size: {x: 281.7143, y: 100}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 31387483
          Name: Send Message
          Text: "Send \"Damage\" Message with the final damage value first, \nThen
            send 'Hit' Message with the transform of the <CombatDamage> component
            as arg."
          Position: {x: 396.57144, y: 204.57143}
          Size: {x: 323.99997, y: 307.42856}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 3288832
          Name: Over Time Effect <Target>
          Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'TargetOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any
            index number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will
            be add to the Target upon hit.
          Position: {x: 1002.8571, y: 680.5714}
          Size: {x: 549.1429, y: 274.85718}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 13413667
          Name: Over Time Effect <Dealer>
          Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'DealerOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any
            index number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will
            be add to the Dealer upon hit.
          Position: {x: 1007.4286, y: 1114.2856}
          Size: {x: 550.28564, y: 314.28577}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
